<description>&lt;p&gt;Coordinated cattle raids in Warrup state killed at least 72 people. A drone strike hit a market in the disputed Abyei region, killing at least 73. Fighting continues in Upper Nile where the Chollo King was airlifted to Juba and the Upper Nile Deputy Governor visited Baliet County after the deadly Adong attack, while Machar disputes Bol Mel’s claims over the Nasir attack. The UN commission warned that the peace deal is being dismantled and 2 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQVUVDcE41Q3gxMklWYm5jZkxDNVpzZEo0clNBZXk5UjB4bGJJR2gyaWZaWDNHVVV5bGNGS0ozZ3I5QWlqaEpBU0JWeHE3Zy1wOWI4OTM0dXMyZ1VtelZvX0gzVmlMc0lvdjROMUFNZU1oUU9TR0J0RllMbGJfdDdLUGFwMXBwdGNWemdZVThzdzdwalhWaU9pTkkzdmR1TGZUX2FkQ3dR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Tamazuj&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQRFVCZlJNN1BEVkFIcVZpcWJEWmdBbFNfak9ueE5rckNXTllYWXR0OXdkdC15OWtwLTNQeVVEc1dBTm1nc1gwMzhvZGkteTRiWnRNaFVqSjNRZGV2RG9rOUIzUnlPSllHVm1fM3BZRDcybVJfNDA5aWNRZGExX1pLVUE0OWh1anA2VHc4TWFqbWZSX2dSOTktUnBpOVlDQU1wSVJLU003ejhmZThVTXg5NA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Tamazuj&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPS2hOV1BldlVpaGRtdk1IdjA5VGxNQS10a0NPcWEzczV1aHRfXzFtX3I0UHRoWXVZTHBNaEZDMzhpQ0lCYVFybFJZeGRlU09DQmtHS0dzWm9ROFNNYUZRQXFjWldhZEFsenFyX09MSmJMR3dFOC1WUUM2SkJCZHNEZk1TSFMtMzc0ZngweG9WVFh0a0FSSy1JeVZFdjJoUF9iV2haT0wzamNNNlpSdjBLVFp1ZkdGQ1lXXzAzNmROSk81QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ohchr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFA2a1d1OTh2TGlzOWlTODRaLXBTSkxLcXRmb1BMVzByM2VwZDFWc3BVWFEtSi1CWWRNOU5OZTlFbmFxNWoyblVwS1BLaUpwbTBHOFZkaE